   $q$According to the passage, how long did families usually keep the books from the wagon?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Only for the afternoon while the wagon was parked nearby","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Forever, because the books were gifts from the librarian","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"For a whole year, until the next school year started","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Until the wagon came back, which was often a month later","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Until the wagon came back, which was often a month later$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 says families "kept them until the wagon came back, often a month later." Nothing in the passage says the books were kept for only an afternoon or given away.$q$, 'draft', '058177d1-2948-5dcf-a08d-1c9cad5ece08')
