   $q$According to the passage, what was the main ingredient in handmade paper in many places?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Cloudy water scooped from a river","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Fresh wood cut from nearby trees","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"outdated-detail"},{"text":"Felt pieces pressed into thin sheets","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Old cloth made of cotton or linen","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Old cloth made of cotton or linen$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 says "the main ingredient was old cloth," such as cotton or linen. Wood was used only "later," so it was not the main ingredient for handmade paper long ago.$q$, 'draft', '6a6d670c-33e5-5154-9a57-ce09c9a1e33e')
