   $q$In paragraph 4, the octopus "darts away." Which word is a synonym for "darts" as it is used here?$q$, $q$[{"text":"drifts","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"antonym-not-synonym"},{"text":"throws","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-homograph-meaning"},{"text":"hides","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"related-not-synonym"},{"text":"races","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$races$q$, $q$The octopus needs to get away fast while the ink "confuses the enemy for a few seconds," so "darts" means races. "Throws" fits the game of darts, a different meaning of the word.$q$, 'draft', 'be6f451d-b89d-521b-9668-dcbabc3d4534')
