   $q$The speaker calls the fall leaves "red boats that sail away from me." What does this description show about the speaker's point of view?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The speaker is afraid of the deep water around the bend.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The speaker sees the creek with imagination and enjoys it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The speaker is upset that the leaves are dirtying the water.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"The speaker has built tiny boats and set them on the creek.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The speaker sees the creek with imagination and enjoys it.$q$, $q$Calling leaves "boats" and waving to each one shows a playful, imaginative view. The boats are a comparison, not real boats the speaker made.$q$, 'draft', 'f5e81445-8903-5af3-917d-8c1af0d5d08c')
