   $q$From what point of view is this story told?$q$, $q$[{"text":"First person, by Rosa telling her own story","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-first-and-third-person"},{"text":"First person, by Aunt Marisol about her niece","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-narrator-with-character"},{"text":"Third person, by a narrator outside the story","is_correct":true},{"text":"Third person, by the stationmaster in the town","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-narrator-with-character"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Third person, by a narrator outside the story$q$, $q$The narrator calls the characters "Rosa," "she" and "her," and never uses "I" outside of dialogue, so it is third person. The stationmaster is a character in the story, not the one telling it.$q$, 'draft', '189b3fb7-c10b-59e6-b29c-4d02a18c8b07')
