   $q$Which signal phrase in Text A shows a cause and effect structure?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"At first\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-texts"},{"text":"\"in the form of\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"\"near the ground\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"describing-words-not-signals"},{"text":"\"As a result\"","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"As a result"$q$, $q$"As a result" connects cooling air (cause) with water drops forming (effect). "At first" appears in Text B and signals time.$q$, 'draft', '0c19487a-7c15-55c6-8ff4-d8a703d36b0f')
