   $q$The prefix mid- means "middle." Where was Rafael's dragon when it "hung in midair"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Tangled in a tree at the edge of the park","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"In the middle of the air, above the ground","is_correct":true},{"text":"Flat on the grass in the middle of the park","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"ignores-root-clues"},{"text":"High in the sky above all the other kites","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In the middle of the air, above the ground$q$, $q$Midair means in the middle of the air, so the kite was still floating before it landed. The passage says it floated to the grass only after that moment.$q$, 'draft', '44cba718-9331-5bff-a0fd-c5d68640ef37')
